{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To woo the history teacher, lovestruck Professor Raventhorpe builds a time-traveling elevator to swipe Nefertari's lost tiara from the past. But when Ari pops by for extra credit, he's swept into an era-hopping adventure\u2014and into the path of history\u2019s greatest tomb raider, Belzoni.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184020/extras/Poster_Gif2.gif?t=1746172397\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184020/extras/5.png?t=1746172397\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Ari Buktu (\u201cAri Buck-Too\u201d)</strong> delivers a heartwarming 2.5D adventure with the spectacle of a summer blockbuster, created by a former Disney ride designer. This 4\u2011hour single\u2011player experience is loaded with hidden collectibles, humorous banter, and warm  vibes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184020/extras/2.png?t=1746172397\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Laugh, uncover hidden treasures, and unravel mysteries in an epic, story-driven adventure\u2014<strong>a heartfelt coming-of-age tale for all ages</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184020/extras/gameplay2.gif?t=1746172397\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184020/extras/3.png?t=1746172397\" /></h2>Dash through ancient tombs, swing over treacherous canyons, race on minecarts, and ride the runaway Anytime Elevator\u2014daring puzzles and lost treasures await around every corner.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184020/extras/1.png?t=1746172397\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into 6 hand-crafted worlds where the zany charm of a Saturday morning cartoon collides with the pulse-pounding thrill of a theme park ride\u2014an adventure unlike anything before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184020/extras/16x9Version3.gif?t=1746172397\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184020/extras/4.png?t=1746172397\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Team up with Professor Raventhorpe (voiced by Ray O\u2019Hare) to conquer time and save history\u2014while Joe Gaudet's Ari steals your heart, and a sweeping orchestral score heightens every thrilling moment.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184020/extras/6.png?t=1746172397\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Wishlist Ari Buktu today</strong> and get ready to claim Nefertari\u2019s Tiara\u2014before history repeats itself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184020/extras/Poster_steam.jpg?t=1746172397\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2184020?t=1746172397","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184020/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746172397","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184020/2b668c69c1cc70b7768a5ac633255eb41811a7d5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746172397","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184020/2b668c69c1cc70b7768a5ac633255eb41811a7d5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746172397","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","i